lass="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">Support/</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">shared with the Support group</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3"><code class="text-foreground font-mono text-sm">My files/</code><span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">only you</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

