ic-panel" aria-labelledby="topic-tab-where" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text2ec67e173f1e</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Self-hosting puts the web app, the API, the LLM gateway and the database on your server.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Sessions run on isolated cloud sandboxes (E2B) and persistent workspace storage.</p></div><table class="bg-background w-full table-fixed border-separate border-spacing-0 rounded-lg border text-left text-sm"><caption class="sr-only">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text2ec67e173f1e</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="w-5/12 border-b p-3 font-normal"><span class="sr-only">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text8570a2e1669f</span></th><th scope="col" class="border-b p-3 font-normal text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text493bdb7154e4</th><th scope="col" class="border-b p-3 font-normal text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.textbeafec79ffdd</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Web app, API, LLM gateway</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Dosco</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Your server</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Database and file storage</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Dosco</td><td class="text-foreground p-3 align-top border-b">Your server</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="text-foreground p-3 align-top font-medium border-b">Accounts, secrets, audit log</th><td class="text-muted-foreground p-3 