y ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text4228aeb07c41</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text5d1e2c1f4d47</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-triggers" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text6f3576da5a31</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.textde2b60f5d4f3</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-computer" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text45815d89cab4</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.texte2e57a269982</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-review" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text3f729bd6d7b5</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text30297e92a239</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="framework-tab-build" aria-controls="framework-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text0a9edbb692b4</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.texta6b72da043a4</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="framework-panel" aria-labelledby="framework-tab-agents" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text279b44d2ab4b</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">An agent is a block in kortix.yaml and a Markdown prompt. The block names its model, tools, connectors and skills.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">Access is deny-by-default. An agent gets no connector, secret or skill the block does not list.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="bg-background flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-lg border"><p class="text-muted-foreground border-b px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text1965f383021e</p><pre class="text-foreground overflow-x-auto px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">  # Marketing</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">  </span><span class="text-foreground">marketing</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">description</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span> <span class="text-kortix-green">Drafts LinkedIn posts from shipped work.</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">prompt_file</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span> <span class="text-kortix-green">agents/marketing/content.md</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">tools</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [read, web_search]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">connectors</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [linkedin, kortix_slack]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">skills</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [write-post]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">commands</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [draft-post]</span></span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre"><span class="text-muted-foreground">    </span><span class="text-foreground">extensions</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">:</span><span class="text-muted-foreground"> [web-access]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="bg-background flex min-w-0 flex-col rounded-lg border"><p class="text-muted-foreground border-b px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs">agents/marketing/content.md</p><pre class="text-foreground overflow-x-auto px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs leading-6"><code><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">You write Arcadia LinkedIn posts from work the team shipped.</span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">Follow the write-post skill and the tone in the company memory.</span><span class="block leading-6 break-words whitespace-pre-wrap lg:min-w-max lg:whitespace-pre">Every post waits for a person to approve it.</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

