ver:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text57ad6644b0eb</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text452aefcb935d</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-access" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text03d5959d51bb</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text144d11a3e58a</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-approve" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text0e5f4cbdf444</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text2ab197ec2cf5</p></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="team-tab-personal" aria-controls="team-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" class="outline-ring duration-moderate w-full rounded-sm text-left opacity-50 transition-opacity ease-out hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 aria-selected:opacity-100"><h3 class="text-foreground text-base font-medium text-pretty">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text708e464e7569</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1 text-sm text-balance">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.texte1424f1d573a</p></button></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="team-panel" aria-labelledby="team-tab-share" class="bg-card flex items-center justify-center border-t p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l lg:p-12"><div class="animate-in fade-in duration-slower flex w-full max-w-xl min-w-0 flex-col gap-8 ease-out"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-medium tracking-tight">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text9d58e473a6dc</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">A session is private to the person who started it. The owner can open it to chosen people and groups, or to the whole project.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-base text-pretty">A public link shows it read-only to anyone with the link. Revoke it at any time.</p></div><div class="bg-background flex flex-col rounded-lg border"><ul class="flex flex-col divide-y"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border"></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.textc080649df657</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">The owner. This is the default.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-foreground"><span class="bg-foreground size-2 rounded-full"></span></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base font-medium">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.textef82bb889266</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">The owner, plus the members and groups they pick.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1.5"><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text682761f025aa</li><li class="bg-muted text-foreground rounded-md px-2.5 py-1 text-sm">Finance</li></ul></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border"></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-foreground text-base">Whole workspace</p><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Every member of the project.</p></div></li></ul><p class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2 border-t p-4 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M165.66,90.34a8,8,0,0,1,0,11.32l-64,64a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32l64-64A8,8,0,0,1,165.66,90.34ZM215.6,40.4a56,56,0,0,0-79.2,0L106.34,70.45a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,11.32l30.06-30a40,40,0,0,1,56.57,56.56l-30.07,30.06a8,8,0,0,0,11.31,11.32L215.6,119.6a56,56,0,0,0,0-79.2ZM138.34,174.22l-30.06,30.06a40,40,0,1,1-56.56-56.57l30.05-30.05a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32L40.4,136.4a56,56,0,0,0,79.2,79.2l30.06-30.07a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.31Z"></path></svg>hardcodedUi.i18nComplete.text6b7396fbb5d0</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;

